ROUTINE Analyze
 ; Optional AI Hub deliverable: an autonomous %AI.Agent that investigates the
 ; GaiaFluxStats table over SQL and writes data/out/analysis.md.
 ; Kept out of ^RunScript on purpose - it makes LLM calls, so its wall-clock is
 ; not ours to control, and ^RunScript is the benchmarked entry point.
 ; Requires OPENAI_API_KEY in the container environment; without it this prints
 ; the reason and exits, leaving result.csv untouched.
 New outDir,report
 Set outDir = "/home/irisowner/dev/data/out"
 Do ##class(%File).CreateDirectoryChain(outDir)
 Write "Running Gaia.Analyst (AI Hub agent, up to 6 LLM iterations)...",!
 Set report = ##class(Gaia.Analyst).Report(outDir_"/analysis.md")
 Write "Analysis: ",outDir,"/analysis.md (",$Length(report)," chars)",!
 Quit
